option they can use today.

41
00:02:09,775 --> 00:02:13,292
Make one inventory entry for the class.
Include the maker,

42
00:02:13,483 --> 00:02:16,399
the exact version or label, the client
and environment,

43
00:02:16,629 --> 00:02:17,581
and the date you checked.

44
00:02:17,942 --> 00:02:20,384
If the picker changes later, repeat that
short check.

45
